1
00:00:00,328 --> 00:00:03,531
Now the body is seen… from a distance.

2
00:00:05,281 --> 00:00:07,168
The body is there,

3
00:00:07,871 --> 00:00:09,507
but where are you?

4
00:00:10,636 --> 00:00:12,094
Inside the body?

5
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:15,312
Where the seeing happens?

6
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,429
No need to decide.

7
00:00:19,485 --> 00:00:20,613
Just notice.

8
00:00:22,153 --> 00:00:24,031
Please raise your right hand,

9
00:00:24,506 --> 00:00:27,134
and notice how your
body moves over there.

10
00:00:28,503 --> 00:00:31,951
Please place your right
hand on your left shoulder.

11
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,433
Please raise your left hand,

12
00:00:38,457 --> 00:00:41,104
and notice how your
body moves over there.

13
00:00:42,692 --> 00:00:46,140
Please place your left
hand on your right shoulder.

14
00:00:50,679 --> 00:00:53,324
You may feel located in the body you see.

15
00:00:54,607 --> 00:00:56,476
Or in the seeing itself.

16
00:00:58,093 --> 00:00:59,671
Or nowhere clear.

17
00:01:00,881 --> 00:01:02,394
Just notice this,

18
00:01:02,418 --> 00:01:03,625
without deciding.

